{
  "about": "A GitHub issue swept in, triaged, worked, reviewed, security-checked, gated, opened as a PR, sent back by a review, reworked, updated on its PR, approved, merged on the go-ahead: each step runs the real sweep, tick_pass or cmd_merge with Scion, GitHub and the gate's podman faked; <step>/<file> is every ticket file the step changed, as written. reports: the report each running agent's stage hands back in that step. Git commits use a fixed date, so the shas are the same on every run.",
